  "limits": [
    "Local owned loopback HTTP and SQL only; no production, provider or live inference calls.",
    "Receiver service-token exchange is stubbed, but receiver EdDSA authentication, JWT verifier, trusted-app gate, canonical machine resolver and SQL are real in Oxy route tests.",
    "Alia tests install an unpublished source-built core fixture; current published core does not expose the new API. Coordinated root-owned release and registry adoption remain required.",
    "No default grants, credentials, user attribution, versions, manifest/lock dependency references or production mutations.",
    "This recipient-specific chat contract does not close generic service-access issues #873/#874."
  ],
